OL,3,GNEWSAFreddie Slater's 'surreal' first
OL,4,Ataste of Formula 1
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile Kimi Antonelli was making history
OL,7,Fas the youngest Formula 1 world
OL,8,Fchampion earlier this month, a British
OL,9,Fteenager was taking his own steps to a
OL,10,Fglittering career in the sport.
OL,12,FFreddie Slater made his debut in the
OL,13,Ffree practice sessions at both the
OL,14,FMexican and Brazilian Grand Prix.
OL,16,FSlater, who grew up in
OL,17,FStratford-upon-Avon and was educated in
OL,18,FBromsgrove, was handed his first
OL,19,Fofficial F1 outing by Audi, and the
OL,20,F18-year-old is one of Britain's
OL,21,Fbrightest motorsport prospects.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
