OL,3,GNEWSAFreddie Slater's 'surreal' first
OL,4,Ataste of Formula 1
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has so far had successful seasons in
OL,7,Fkarting and cars, most recently
OL,8,Ffinishing runner up in the Formula 3
OL,9,FChampionship, and told the BBC his
OL,10,Flatest experiences were "surreal".
